1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,987
Many apps look completely different across devices, which easily confuses older users.

2
00:00:05,937 --> 00:00:12,675
PNCC Care uses a unified system that connects phones, tablets, and smartwatches seamlessly.

3
00:00:12,675 --> 00:00:15,662
Best of all, it works offline-first.

4
00:00:15,662 --> 00:00:23,875
Even if home Wi-Fi drops out or someone is in the basement with no signal, tapping the check-in button saves the record safely on the device.

5
00:00:23,875 --> 00:00:29,200
As soon as the connection returns, it automatically syncs with the rest of the family.

6
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:37,375
It uses less than 2 kilobytes of data a day and barely sips battery, so even older smartphones run it smoothly without slowdowns.

